WEBVTT

1
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:31.420
Sarnaut... That's what Sarnaut's prison looks like. Yes, I see the Creator's hand in everything.

2
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:36.140
Forgotten friend, you have sacrificed so much for us all.

3
00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.140
Mother...

4
00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.560
My daughter. You called, and I'm here.

5
00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.320
I didn't think you'd answer... Because I...

6
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:53.320
I had to come. You were dead, and you came back. You were lost and you were found.

7
00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.540
We will always be together now.

8
00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:05.760
Yes! You've always forgiven her anything.

9
00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.760
But ENOUGH!

10
00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:20.760
You have no place in Sarn's world! Go away! You will not defile it!

11
00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.760
But this is my world!

12
00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:31.640
And when you enter it, you obey my laws.

13
00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.360
This is the finale of the Play!

14
00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:46.220
Sarnaut is the prison world for the god of Light, and now you will suffer the same fate he did!

15
00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:58.220
Noooo! No, no, no... You will never get what you want!
